<title>CANADA: Canada Oct advance Raw Materials Price Index rises.</title>
<headline>Canada Oct advance Raw Materials Price Index rises.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The early estimate for Canada's raw materials price index is for a 0.2 percent rise in October from September, Statistics Canada said on Friday.</p>
<p>    INDEXES			  Oct</p>
<p>    Mineral fuels		 +2.8</p>
<p>    Metals			  -1.5</p>
<p>    Vegetable and animal	-1.8</p>
<p>    Wood			    +0.3</p>
<p>    Index ex mineral fuels    -1.1</p>
<p>The early estimate is based on partial returns and other indicators.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Paul-Romeo Danis at 613-951-3350.)</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745</p>
</text>
